  "description": "Authored spin position catalogue. Every playable spin position is declared here with its difficulty flag, its reference pose asset, the tolerance within which the player must hold it, and its moment-of-inertia scale. Difficulty is DECLARED here rather than detected at runtime; the simulation only verifies that a declared position was actually attained and held. See docs/level-features.md.",

